    },
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100111/1006001001110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いきなりどうしたんだ？\r\n次の衣装の話か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001110020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。ちょっとした占いだよ。今読んでいた雑誌に、\r\n色でみる性格診断というコーナーがあってね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100111/1006001001110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうことか……\r\nうーん。黒で連想するものと言えば……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "いろいろなもの",
    "nextLabel": "1006001001111"
  },
  {
    "select": "かっこよさ",
    "nextLabel": "1006001001112"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "孤高",
    "nextLabel": "1006001001113"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001110030,
    "label": "1006001001111",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そのイメージは、ある意味で正しいのかもしれないね……\r\nカラスのように、様々な色が混ざった末に生まれる色……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100111/1006001001110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001110040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "雑誌に載っていない解答とは斬新だね\r\nフフ、やはりアナタは面白い",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100111/1006001001110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001110050,
    "label": "1006001001112",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "確かに黒はかっこよさの表現に使われるね\r\n特に、ファッションではそうだな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100111/1006001001110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001110060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そういえば、私の私服も黒が多いような気がするね\r\nアナタにとって私は、かっこいい存在だということかな",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100111/1006001001110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001110070,
    "label": "1006001001113",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なるほど、孤高か……結果は、\r\n『クールに見せかけて、内面に寂しさを抱えている』らしい",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100111/1006001001110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001110080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……もしかして、プロデューサーは寂しいのかい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
